            {
                "entry_id": "188cdc84-8ac9-3a90-8dab-741d1e1a38f0",
                "word": "Lolly",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f63b17f8-237b-364a-8bd0-f9c91866fd81",
                        "entry_id": "188cdc84-8ac9-3a90-8dab-741d1e1a38f0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A diminutive of the female given names Laura or Louise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "84850801-e0d7-41e5-aaaa-dd6a943a42b9",
                                "sense_id": "f63b17f8-237b-364a-8bd0-f9c91866fd81",
                                "text": "Louise Bergeret (Lolly) was a year older than Enid;[…]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67cc102d-9b98-4236-a833-649ba15ddf83",
                                "sense_id": "f63b17f8-237b-364a-8bd0-f9c91866fd81",
                                "text": "He could see it all, with that certificate before him reading “Alice Louise Cameron” — Lolly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd9c4608-53df-4c88-8037-9794f004275e",
                                "sense_id": "f63b17f8-237b-364a-8bd0-f9c91866fd81",
                                "text": "“Lolly, huh? Short for Louise no doubt.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "016a24d6-4f00-37e8-931d-8a709644dad3",
                "word": "lolly",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4a1c2b49-65ba-4961-8145-c0d6c82f6006",
                        "entry_id": "016a24d6-4f00-37e8-931d-8a709644dad3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lollies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4772daf0-3eda-3efd-8946-7201dad35773",
                        "entry_id": "016a24d6-4f00-37e8-931d-8a709644dad3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A piece of hard candy on a stick; a lollipop."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4118e64-591d-48a0-a54b-d66bcda40dea",
                                "sense_id": "4772daf0-3eda-3efd-8946-7201dad35773",
                                "text": "Trim the lolly sticks, so that you have a stem of about 3–4cm to stick into the cake, and then plunge the sticks of the foreshortened lollies into the cake so that the ghoulish faces leer out from their black-frosted graveyard."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2eb80eb8-6971-3679-bf0e-36c8bf0a5e50",
                        "entry_id": "016a24d6-4f00-37e8-931d-8a709644dad3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An ice lolly; a popsicle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Ireland",
                            "UK",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d341630b-f75f-34d4-8641-7bcba775de54",
                        "entry_id": "016a24d6-4f00-37e8-931d-8a709644dad3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any confection made from sugar, or high in sugar content; a sweet, a piece of candy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "New-Zealand",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94f525e8-5340-4dd1-9049-c1c4b69a2c2a",
                                "sense_id": "d341630b-f75f-34d4-8641-7bcba775de54",
                                "text": "Leaving the Domain, I walked back to the hotel, noticing the queer signs by the way. One was “Lollies for Sale.” It was over the door of a confectioner′s store where all sorts of candies were displayed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c796b2cd-839d-4c13-a047-2ff98dff2386",
                                "sense_id": "d341630b-f75f-34d4-8641-7bcba775de54",
                                "text": "Organise the students into small groups. Send a letter home to the parents stating that the science lesson will involve students eating a small amount of lollies. Check which students are allowed to eat lollies. Students with diabetes will only be able to observe or they could bring their own ‘special’ sweets from home."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5faee34f-87f0-415a-805e-16b96e7650b0",
                                "sense_id": "d341630b-f75f-34d4-8641-7bcba775de54",
                                "text": "He looked straight into Frau Diller′s spectacled eyes and said, ‘Mixed lollies, please.’\nFrau Diller smiled.[…]‘Here,’ she said, tossing a single lolly onto the counter. ‘Mix it yourself.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c28ffbb-ecf4-30f2-b2d2-62e5cfcdcb51",
                        "entry_id": "016a24d6-4f00-37e8-931d-8a709644dad3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An easy catch."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
